				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "ESD / hot-plug TVS on the incoming +3V3_HOST at J2 (HDG 1.3.2: protection at the power entrance). Unidirectional, cathode (pin 1) to +3V3_HOST. VRWM 3.3V, VBR 4.0V min at 1mA, clamp 7.0V max at 1A (already above the TPS2116 6V and module 3.6V abs max, so it covers ESD and connector transients, not surges; C7 and the rail capacitance take the energy), 500W 8/20us, 500pF, leakage 125uA max at 3.3V (more at a +5% host and high temperature). Bourns recommended land (L 0.8 / S 1.4 / W 0.5mm). Replaces the TVS0500."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "395f7b26-202e-4e38-ad58-73fedcb8caa5")
